      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Land Owner can create a Hunting event on his lands\n-The Reward for land
    owner is 10% of Coins, materials and 100% Gins that all of other player earn 
    in events, \nThe land owner must have item (like portal key) to create event,\nother
    player join in event has chance to fight with huge of mob, greater mob with high
    level to farming. (in current game we only found 1 greater mob in each 4 hours),
    All drop rate and formula is same normal mode\nand players can move to owner
    's place so they can travel and capture outpost in many place where event start"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
